### Peticiones de prueba para api-gateway (Sesión 4)
### IntelliJ IDEA (HTTP Client): los login guardan el token con client.global.set(...).
### VS Code (REST Client): copia el accessToken de cada login en la variable {{...Token}} correspondiente.
### TODO entra por el puerto 8080: el gateway envía cada petición al servicio que le corresponde según su ruta. Requiere los cinco servicios en marcha.

@host = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@actuator = http://localhost:8080/actuator
# Cambia estos valores por los ids que devuelven las peticiones "Crear ..."
@bookingId = 1

### ---------- AUTENTICACIÓN (ejecutar primero) ----------

### Login CUSTOMER Ana (ana@mail.com) -> 200
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@mail.com",
  "password": "Customer123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("anaToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Login ORGANIZER (organizer@ticketing.pe) -> 200
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "organizer@ticketing.pe",
  "password": "Organizer123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("organizerToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Login ADMIN (admin@ticketing.pe) -> 200
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ticketing.pe",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### ---------- CATÁLOGO (event-service) ----------

### Cartelera pública, sin token -> 200 (header X-Gateway)
GET {{host}}/events?status=PUBLISHED

### Crear recinto sin token -> 401 (lo corta el gateway)
POST {{host}}/venues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arena Gateway",
  "city": "Lima",
  "address": "Av. Javier Prado 100",
  "capacity": 3000
}

### Crear recinto como CUSTOMER -> 403 (lo corta event-service)
POST {{host}}/venues
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arena Gateway",
  "city": "Lima",
  "address": "Av. Javier Prado 100",
  "capacity": 3000
}

### Crear recinto como ORGANIZER -> 201
POST {{host}}/venues
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arena Gateway",
  "city": "Lima",
  "address": "Av. Javier Prado 100",
  "capacity": 3000
}

### ---------- COMPRA (booking-service → event-service y payment-service) ----------

### Reservar como Ana -> 201
POST {{host}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "ticketCategoryId": 2,
  "quantity": 1
}

### Pagar -> 200 CONFIRMED
POST {{host}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}

### Mis reservas -> 200
GET {{host}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}

### Pagos de la reserva (ADMIN, payment-service) -> 200
GET {{host}}/payments?bookingId={{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ---------- USUARIOS (user-service) ----------

### Mi perfil -> 200
GET {{host}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}

### Rutas configuradas en el gateway (Actuator) -> 200
GET {{actuator}}/gateway/routes
